<title>USA: GE medical unit, Elscint in joint venture.</title>
<headline>GE medical unit, Elscint in joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>GE Medical Systems said on Monday it agreed in principle to form a joint venture with Elscint Ltd of Haifa, Israel, to make nuclear medicine products.</p>
<p>The venture, a 50-50 partnership, would manufacture the products in Haifa and supply them to both companies.</p>
<p>GE Medical is owned by General Electric Co.</p>
